{"2463650": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bomb Squad", "steam_appid": 2463650, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb Squad is a cooperative communication game where every player holds a piece of the solution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hosting a party? Hanging out with friends or family? Looking for a team-building experience that actually gets people working together?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bomb Squad, 2–4 players must solve puzzles across 8 mini-games. The twist: each player sees only part of the information. Success depends on how well you communicate, listen, and make decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it calm and strategic… or watch it turn into fast-paced, hilarious confusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you whether Frank fails or does a dance in the disposal room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses the players' own smartphones as controllers and a PC-connected TV that drives the play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How it works:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download the controller app via the link either our website or discord channel listed on the right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install on either PC or Mac </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect to a private wifi network</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phase 1 localization complete!! Adds interface support for 12 languages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together or suffer together, the choice is yours.</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bomb Squad is a cooperative communication game where every player holds a piece of the solution.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hosting a party? Hanging out with friends or family? Looking for a team-building experience that actually gets people working together?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Bomb Squad, 2–4 players must solve puzzles across 8 mini-games. The twist: each player sees only part of the information. Success depends on how well you communicate, listen, and make decisions under pressure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play it calm and strategic… or watch it turn into fast-paced, hilarious confusion.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's up to you whether Frank fails or does a dance in the disposal room. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game uses the players' own smartphones as controllers and a PC-connected TV that drives the play.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>How it works:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Download the controller app via the link either our website or discord channel listed on the right</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Install on either PC or Mac </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Connect to a private wifi network</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Phase 1 localization complete!! Adds interface support for 12 languages!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work together or suffer together, the choice is yours.</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "You and your closest frenemies must work together on a common goal – to diffuse a ticking time bomb! 2-4 Players will face a series of challenges at a pace that you cannot control.Your responses to these challenges determines if your team goes home alive.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, German, Japanese, Korean, Polish, Portuguese - Brazil, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Turkish, Serbian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463650/1e1c911946ff1a4d936fab0392d963193cd08717/header.jpg?t=1783138698", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2463650/57574a01a6dddfab29e3d1a8292d9e8c454d37d7/capsule